      "content": "i mean i know i should talk to the doctor but they're booked for like three weeks and i really need to focus for work tomorrow. i feel okay right now, just a little bit of a racing heart here and there. if i just take a half dose of the adderall it would probably be fine right? or like, is there a way to know for sure if it's actually dangerous since i'm not feeling anything crazy yet?",
